Third-party materials
=====================

`.cursor/skills/google-ads-api-quickstart` and
`.cursor/skills/google-ads-api-mcp-setup` are copies of Google's official
Google Ads API agent skills (metadata.author: google-ads-api-team).

They are included so Cursor can walk through credentials and the official
read-only MCP. For the upstream MCP server see:

  https://github.com/googleads/google-ads-mcp

Project-specific wiring is in `.cursor/skills/google-ads-optimizer-stack`.
Writes to Google Ads go through this app (AI Assistant / `/api/mutate`),
not through the official MCP.

Other dependencies are listed in `pyproject.toml` and keep their own licenses.
